@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Worker Contact and Entitlement API
	Testing Koroneiki Worker Contact and Entitlement API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the external links for the contact with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| deletionexternallink |
	* I tear down the contact entitlement definitions on koroneiki with the following name values
	| Deletion Entitlement |
	* I tear down the product purchases on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Deletion" for the following products
	| Deletion Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| Deletion Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Deletion Account Worker Role |
	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Deletion |

Scenario: Delete worker contact with entitlement and team and external links
	Koroneiki worker contacts with entitlements and teams and external links that end up deleted should have their respective associations removed as well.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORDEL                             |
	| Description  | Test deletion account on koroneiki |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                       |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Deletion                 |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                       |
	| Region       | United States                      |
	| Status       | Approved                           |
	| Tier         | Regular                            |
	| Website      | www.koroneikideletion.com          |
	And I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                 |
	| Language      | English                                   |
	| Last Name     | Deletion1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                      |
	And I create an external link for the contact with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneiki            |
	| Entity Id   | deletionexternallink |
	| Entity Name | DeletionExternalLink |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the Deletion worker role for accounts |
	| Name        | Deletion Account Worker Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Worker                                |
	And I assign worker contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Deletion"
	| koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Koroneiki Deletion"
	| koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Koroneiki Deletion" to the following roles	
	| Deletion Account Worker Role |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Deletion Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Deletion" and the product "Deletion Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	And I create a contact entitlement definition related to the product purchase of the product "Deletion Digital Experience Platform" and contact role with the name "Deletion Account Worker Role" and type "Account Worker" with the following values
	| Description | Deletion Entitlement Description |
	| Name        | Deletion Entitlement             |
	| Status      | Approved                         |
	Then the contact entitlement definition with the name "Deletion Entitlement" should be present with the following values
	| Description | Deletion Entitlement Description |
	| Name        | Deletion Entitlement             |
	| Status      | Approved                         |
	And the contact entitlement definition with the name "Deletion Entitlement" should be present via the entitlement definition key with the following values
	| Description | Deletion Entitlement Description |
	| Name        | Deletion Entitlement             |
	| Status      | Approved                         |
	When I synchronize the contact entitlement definition with the name "Deletion Entitlement"
	And I create a nested field for the contact entitlement coming from the entitlement definition "Deletion Entitlement"
	Then the entitlement from the entitlement definition "Deletion Entitlement" should be visible via nested field on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And the external link with the entity id "deletionexternallink" should be present on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneiki            |
	| Entity Id   | deletionexternallink |
	| Entity Name | DeletionExternalLink |
	When I delete a contact on koroneiki with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.deletion1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And the worker contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be assigned the team "Koroneiki Automotive"